# unit_local_ns_call under --walk-methods: a method with its own named Structure stays native (2b-1, pinned), and S's
# procedure is never walked -- its occurrence is built natively, at S's statement, with the trampoline as its native
# word.  Each call stores S's initializer again: 4 after each.  Entry 7.
fn: m () int
    S:
        size_t: v 4U
    S\v: 9U
    S()
    size_t: a 9U
    a: S\v
    S\v: 9U
    S: ()
    size_t: b 9U
    b: S\v
    S\v: 9U
    S
    size_t: c 9U
    c: S\v
    int: r 0
    if: a = 4U && b = 4U && c = 4U
        r: 7
    int: out r
    return: out
end: m
int: r 0
r: m()
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: r; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
